    "name": "Riftborn",
    "steam_appid": 3421920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftborn is a multiplayer slasher arena of three factions where Humans, Undead, and Monsters will face off in arena. With different classes and abilities, each match is filled with strategy and action. Fight in the cursed ruins, gain dominance in the depths of the ancient fortress. Each arena requires cunning, teamwork, and the ability to win. Whether you're wielding a knight's blade, casting magic, or tearing through enemies like a monstrous beast, one thing is for sure: chaos reigns and the fun never stops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/4f85a406f595d00fb3507b43a4367cdd.poster.avif?t=1746531537\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/4f85a406f595d00fb3507b43a4367cdd.webm?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/4f85a406f595d00fb3507b43a4367cdd.mp4?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many ways to kill your opponents: swords, axes, bows, crossbows, daggers, knives, spears, magic of your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/ad7fe4530d7a039243230f12de93d45e.poster.avif?t=1746531537\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/ad7fe4530d7a039243230f12de93d45e.webm?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/ad7fe4530d7a039243230f12de93d45e.mp4?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftborn features a variety of game modes designed to suit different play styles. Players will be able to fight in chaotic Free-for-All (FFA) mode, coordinate with their mates in Team Deathmatch (TDM), and test their mettle in Last Team Standing (LTS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/d12208f80eeac90105cab20c97b5af30.poster.avif?t=1746531537\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/d12208f80eeac90105cab20c97b5af30.webm?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/d12208f80eeac90105cab20c97b5af30.mp4?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three teams with 12 unique player classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique ultimate abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, skill-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, axes, bows, and magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical and challenging achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftborn is a multiplayer slasher arena of three factions where Humans, Undead, and Monsters will face off in arena. With different classes and abilities, each match is filled with strategy and action. Fight in the cursed ruins, gain dominance in the depths of the ancient fortress. Each arena requires cunning, teamwork, and the ability to win. Whether you're wielding a knight's blade, casting magic, or tearing through enemies like a monstrous beast, one thing is for sure: chaos reigns and the fun never stops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/4f85a406f595d00fb3507b43a4367cdd.poster.avif?t=1746531537\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/4f85a406f595d00fb3507b43a4367cdd.webm?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/4f85a406f595d00fb3507b43a4367cdd.mp4?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many ways to kill your opponents: swords, axes, bows, crossbows, daggers, knives, spears, magic of your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/ad7fe4530d7a039243230f12de93d45e.poster.avif?t=1746531537\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/ad7fe4530d7a039243230f12de93d45e.webm?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/ad7fe4530d7a039243230f12de93d45e.mp4?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftborn features a variety of game modes designed to suit different play styles. Players will be able to fight in chaotic Free-for-All (FFA) mode, coordinate with their mates in Team Deathmatch (TDM), and test their mettle in Last Team Standing (LTS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/d12208f80eeac90105cab20c97b5af30.poster.avif?t=1746531537\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/d12208f80eeac90105cab20c97b5af30.webm?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421920/extras/d12208f80eeac90105cab20c97b5af30.mp4?t=1746531537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three teams with 12 unique player classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique ultimate abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, skill-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, axes, bows, and magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical and challenging achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Riftborn is a multiplayer first-person slasher inspired by the iconic style of 90s games. Choose your side \u2014 Humans, Undead, or Monsters \u2014and engage in intense arena battles. Discover a wide range of weapons and characters, each with their own unique abilities.",
